# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Musicosy — environment variable template
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill with real values. NEVER commit `.env.local`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Precedence (Next.js): .env.local > .env.{NODE_ENV}.local > .env.{NODE_ENV}
# > .env. .env.local is loaded in ALL environments and overrides everything else.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Prisma / SQLite (Help Center file-based CMS) ─────────────────────────────
# Primary data source for the Help Center.
DATABASE_URL="file:/home/z/my-project/db/custom.db"

# ── Supabase (client SDK + service role) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Used by frontend Supabase client + any server-side service-role calls.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=""             # https://[project-ref].supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""       # public anon key (RLS-enforced)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""# SECRET — bypasses RLS. Never expose to client.
